					"speakerTitle": "慕珍"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550102,
					"content": "欸——？這就事不關己了嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726550103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550103,
					"content": "怎麼可能啦，既然離我們所需的東西只剩一步之遙了，我們現在就出發，捕獵遺蹟機械吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726550104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "慕珍"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550104,
					"content": "剛剛還以為妳要回船上呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726550105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550105,
					"content": "唉，算了，我們也一起去吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
