				{
					"id": 726550301,
					"content": "怎麼，還需要熱身一下嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726550302,
						726550303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "慕珍"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550302,
					"content": "關於遺蹟…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726550304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726550304,
					"content": "畢竟我是航船技術官，陸地上的歷史我懂得不多，抱歉啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726550305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "慕珍"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550305,
					"content": "不過這些遺蹟，我想都與五百年前那場大災難有關…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726550306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "慕珍"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550306,
					"content": "我以前曾經聽老水手們提起過那場大災，據說不論海陸都沒有倖免深淵的侵襲…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726550307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "慕珍"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550307,
					"content": "不過對我來說，和嚇唬小孩的鬼故事差不多啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726550308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "慕珍"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550308,
					"content": "畢竟親眼所見的可怕，才是真的可怕！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "慕珍"
				},
				{
					"id": 726550303,
					"content": "關於神秘的機械…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
